OL,5,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FRussell battles waterlogged tracks
OL,7,     Fin the desert as he tries to
OL,8,     Fdeliver his load on time.
OL,9,     FMeanwhile, Yogi's reputation is
OL,10,     Fhanging in the balance on the
OL,11,     Fbiggest week of his career.
OL,12,G0200 Trucking Heavy
